      "message": "`should_defer_rollback_protection` can only be true only if `llpvm_changes` is set. \n\nThe earlier logic for this block was\n```\nif cfg!(llpvm_changes)\n        \u0026\u0026 should_defer_rollback_protection(fdt)?\n        \u0026\u0026 verified_boot_data.has_capability(Capability::SecretkeeperProtection)\n```\n\nbut (in this patch) I remove cfg!(llpvm_changes), because that is not needed/covered by `should_defer_rollback_protection`, wdyt?\n\nIt has become less readable though, but readability has been drastically reduced due to trunk flags anyway.\n\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/virtualizationmanager/src/aidl.rs;l\u003d434-442?q\u003duntrusted_props.push",
